cases.new_string:
// ONE announcement rule for the whole transcript: a message is in it once
// the host has told every reader about it, and not a moment before. Pi is
// ahead of its own announcements at BOTH ends of a message — it assigns
// `state.streamingMessage` before awaiting the `message_start` hook, and it
