// compaction is not one — `waitForIdle()` returns immediately, so the
// report went out while Pi was still inside the compaction. A slow
// `session_before_compact` hook holds that window open for as long as it
// likes, and the caller was told the thread had stopped. Only the ANSWER
// waits: what the stop reached was decided before the first await, above.
if (record.compaction.active) await this.awaitCompactionEnd(record);

