/**
 * IAP stamps the user's email behind a namespace, as
 * `accounts.google.com:ran.avidor@gmail.com`. The prefix names the identity
 * provider, not the person, and every record this host writes is read as an
 * address — so it comes off here, at the one place identity enters.
