 *
 * A 4xx is the server turning the request down before acting on it, which is
 * the only answer that proves nothing happened. Anything else non-2xx may have
 * got as far as doing the work and failed on the way back — this app's own
 * create route answers 500 from a step that runs once the chat exists.
